{
  "uid": "swc-events",
  "title": "swcollect · Events and logs",
  "description": "Orion events, alert history, syslog / traps and configuration changes as stored in Loki: one entry per row, the line is the row exactly as received. Loki places each entry by the declared per-source time rule. Push vs poll comes from sw_meta.alert_reconcile.",
